Open Crop Icons (CC0 1.0)
https://github.com/openfarmcc/open-crop-icons

The files under open-crop-icons/ are from the Open Crop Icons project by the OpenFarm
community. They are released under CC0 1.0 (public domain). You may use them without
restriction. Attribution is not required; see the project README for details.

These files live under client/public/assets/crop-icons/ so they are copied into the
Angular build output at /assets/crop-icons/.

Original icons in original/ (grasland, tulip, flower-bulb) are part of OpenGewasKaart
and licensed under the same terms as the application (MIT).

sugar-beet.svg is a recolor of the CC0 beet icon (cream root, green leaves) so
suikerbiet is not shown as a red beet. It is kept here because upstream has no
sugar-beet icon.
